Problem:
Use of Multiple displays during AI proctored online assessments.

Context:
Placement assessments must provide a fair chance for every candidate. Finding ways around the system discourages genuine candidates.

Solution:
Test platform providers must explore system level SDKs to detect second monitor displays as these APIs can easily provide information about the connected devices like Ethernet, Monitor, Microcontrollers etc.
A lightweight device agent of their own can abstract away COM ports and directly provide information about connected devices.
